A zoom lens comprising, in order from an object side toward an image side:

a first lens group G1 having positive refractive power;

a second lens group G2 having negative refractive power;

a third lens group G3 having positive refractive power and being movable along an optical axis to perform focusing; and

a fourth lens group G4 having positive refractive power and disposed on the image side of the third lens group G3,

wherein at least one axial spacing between adjacent lens groups is varied during zooming.
